# Emergency AI helper (Gemini)
# 1. Copy this file and name the copy .env (same folder). .env is git-ignored, so your key never gets committed.
# 2. Paste your key after the = sign (get one at Google AI Studio). No quotes, no spaces.
# 3. Run: npm run dev
# The key is only read by the local dev server / Vercel function, never sent to the browser.
GEMINI_API_KEY=

# Optional
# GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-3.8-flash
# GEMINI_FALLBACK_MODELS=gemini-3.7-flash,gemini-3.5-flash   (tried in order if the main model is busy or missing)
# ALLOWED_ORIGINS=https://your-other-domain.example
